{
  "job_B3.3.1.2_20261117_184044": {
    "chunk_text": "Sendon on carcern, & hie hine heton \u00fe\u00e6t attor etan; & he hit etan nolde. For\u00f0on \u00fee his heorte n\u00e6s tolysedu, ne his mod n\u00e6s onwended. Ah he w\u00e6s simle hine to Drihtne gebiddende mid myclum wope, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him, Min Drihten H\u00e6lend & ic \u00fee bidde, Dryhten, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu me forgife minra eagena leoht, \u00fe\u00e6t ic geseo \u00fea me onginna\u00f0 don on & mid \u00fey \u00fee he \u00feis gebed se eadiga Matheus gecweden h\u00e6fde, mycel leoht & frea beorht onlyhte \u00fe\u00e6t Se eadiga Matheus \u00fea lociende geseah Drihten Crist; & eft Drihten w\u00e6s cwe\u00feende, Matheus, wes \u00feu Ac onbid her seofon & twentig nihta; \u00e6fter \u00feon ic sende to \u00fee Andreas \u00feinne bro\u00feor, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fee & mid \u00fey \u00fee \u00feis gecweden w\u00e6s, Drihten him eft tocw\u00e6\u00f0, Sib sy mid \u00fee, Matheus. He \u00fea \u00feurhwunigende mid gebedum w\u00e6s Drihtnes lof singende on \u00fe\u00e6m carcerne. & \u00fea unrihtan men ineodan on \u00fe\u00e6t carcern, \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fea men utl\u00e6dan woldan & him to mete don. Se eadiga Matheus \u00fea betynde his eagan, \u00fee l\u00e6s \u00fea cwelleras gesawon \u00fe\u00e6t his eagan geopenode w\u00e6ron, Se eadiga Matheus \u00fea gefylde XX daga. \u00dea Drihten H\u00e6lend Crist cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00f0\u00e6m halgan Andrea his apostole, mid \u00fey \u00fee he w\u00e6s in Achaia \u00fe\u00e6m He cw\u00e6\u00f0, Gang on Mermedonia ceastre, & al\u00e6de \u00feonon Matheum \u00feinne bro",
